Z||000000||Monkeyman||06-03-2000||11:19 AM||||That's a lie.  I'm downright PI**ED OFF!  I had planned on purchasing some seats from a Z24 Cav from an ex forum member.  (Great price--shipping only--about $35/each)  He got my check and said that he would send them right away.  After a few weeks, I decided to call him and find out where the seats were.  I finally got ahold of his wife (she said he was too chicken to take care if it himself) and she said that he got rid of the seats. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Now I have to start looking for some inexpensive, cool seats again.  I passed up a nice set of Beretta seats a few weeks ago because I was waiting on these!  What a male appendage! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||frontal lobe||06-04-2000||03:06 AM||||Sorry, monkeyman.  Character, consideration, and common courtesy are sadly on the decline in our country.  Hope at least they didn't cash the check.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||06-04-2000||10:54 AM||||Hi, Doc.  His wife said that they didn't cash the check and would send it back.  I hope so.  I'd hate to have to press charges or sue him.  It was a little less than $100, that's tons of $$ to me.  Like I said, now I have to find some nice seats. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||Raydar||06-04-2000||11:03 AM||||She must be very proud of him.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Good luck with your search.<BR>I believe that S-10 / Sonoma / (little)Blazer seats may fit too, since they are sometimes traded back and forth with Camaros. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||06-04-2000||12:00 PM||||Didn't know about the S-10 seats.  I'll have to check those out.  I was/am hoping to find some cool seats in great condition for less than $100/set.  Mine won't injure me, but the look like he!!.  Actually, I have seat covers on so I really don't know what the passenger side looks like.  Probably in great shape.  I'm not in as big a hurry for seats as I used to be.  Gotta do the brakes 1st unless somebody wants to trust me.||||reg||1
