Z||000010||bHooper||06-05-2000||09:48 AM||||Years ago, I test fitted a set of seats out of a '87 vette convertable.<P>Guess what?<P><BR>They fit!<P>I cant remember if you have to swap the seat rails or not... but the seats certainly fit the location!<P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000011||DJRice||06-05-2000||10:00 AM||||The seat frames that we have in Fieros have been in use for quite a while.  You should be able to look in a Firebird, Camaro, Sunbird, Cavalier, Grand Am, Grand Prix, etc.  <P>I have a suspicion that Saturn Seats will work too, but I havent been able to convince my Girlfriend to let me dismantle her car...||||reg||1
